# claude: this fork never had a .gitignore at all - build outputs were
# neither tracked nor ignored (presumably no one had previously run a
# real build in a git-tracked checkout of this specific fork). Covers
# both the real-hardware build outputs (kernel.img/kernel.list/
# kernel.map/build/) and the additive QEMU-only ones (kernel-qemu.img/
# kernel-qemu.map - NOT kernel-qemu.ld, which is a real source file).
# Deliberately does NOT ignore source/fs.img, source/initcode, or
# source/font1.bin/font.bin - these are pre-built binaries .incbin'd
# directly into the kernel image and are meant to be checked in (see
# notes_arch_rpi1.txt).
build/
kernel.img
kernel.list
kernel.map
kernel-qemu.img
kernel-qemu.map
